SUMMARY:Jim Thorpe Weekend/Bike Train
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nJoin members and friends 
 for a weekend of bicycle riding in Jim Thorpe.\nCheck into the hotel on Fr
 iday\, November 13th.\nOn Saturday check in at train station at 8am for th
 e 9:15 am train to White Haven.\n**Lehigh Gorge Scenic Railway Bike Train 
 Rail Trail Ride:**\n1 Susquehanna Street\, Jim Thorpe\, PA.\nThey start to
  load bikes at 8:00am\; train departs promptly at 9:15am. Bring a packed l
 unch.\nWe will plan to stop for lunch along the trail at one of the picnic
  spots. We will ride the historic train up through the Gorge with our bike
 s\, about one hour\, to White Haven. Then we will ride the crushed stone r
 ail trail back along the Scenic Lehigh Gorge to Jim Thorpe. You must purch
 ase your train ticket in advance\, $39. Call 570-325-8485 to purchase your
  ticket \, visit [www.lgsry.com](http://www.lgsry.com) for more informatio
 n. Please note that there are no refunds on tickets if the ride is cancell
 ed or if\, due to inclement weather\, the train does not run that day. How
 ever\, bike train tickets do not expire and can be used another day. There
  is no free parking in Jim Thorpe\, $10/day (cash only)per vehicle to park
  in municipal lot\, where the train station is located\, at 1 Susquehanna 
 Street\, Jim Thorpe\, PA.\nYour $39 ticket is for those who are bringing y
 our own bike. These tickets are limited. It cost double to rent one of the
 ir bikes. You must make your decision and buy a ticket two months in advan
 ce. Helmets are mandatory for all of our rides. Parking lot has an attenda
 nt and is patrolled.\n3 minute video of bike train and rail trail:\n[https
 ://youtu.be/2KYaJWwh9D0](https://youtu.be/2KYaJWwh9D0)\nOn Sunday morning 
 we will check out of the hotel and at 9am we will meet in Jim Thorpe at th
 e trailhead \, Packer Hill Road\, for the Switchback trail\, biking 9 mile
 s to Summit Hill and back. This is a gravel trail. Afterwards… those who
  want to go out to lunch together before traveling home.\n\nLodging: **Cou
 ntry Inn and Suites**\nLeighton/ Jim Thorpe 1619 Interchange Rd Lehighton\
 , Pa\nPhone 610-826-4344 and tell them “Lancaster Bicycle Club”\nor us
 e this link below for a special rate of $199 a night for Fri & Sat or edit
  the number of nights (reduced rate until October 13th) each room can slee
 p up to 4-6 persons\n[https://www.choicehotels.com/reservations/groups/WQ4
 9O9](https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.
 choicehotels.com%2Freservations%2Fgroups%2FWQ49O9&data=05%7C02%7C%7C561520
 c30e8d448f790808def954761c%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C63
 9222338327230783%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwL
 jAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&s
 data=1KRsrl2zHcG3mFUs3I8Hxw0V17ztc2bKaJqWgu8fnhM%3D&reserved=0 "Protected 
 by Outlook: https://www.choicehotels.com/reservations/groups/WQ49O9. Click
  or tap to follow the link.")\n\nRichard Conner 717-572-8480
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3161020
 81/
