SUMMARY:Impromptu Ride -  MTCP Wii Ride (19F) RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride leader: Joanie N.*
 *\n**Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)**\n**Anticipated Average Pace: \\~11 mph
