 route/mtcp-wii-ride/)\n**(Check out the new LBC route library web page!)**
 \n(Thank you Phil Newswanger)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\
 n\n**The ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed. This is in
 tended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride l
 eader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasional regr
 oupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to pace capabilitie
 s.**\n\n**Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with
  the group.**\n**Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and
  a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n**T
 o eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club me
 mbership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not
  mean you are a club member. Join here** [Member Signup](https://www.lanca
 sterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Your RSVP is y
 our agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct:** [Code of Conduct](
 https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&m
 odule_id=323984)\n**Guidance if an incident occurs:** [Incident Actions](h
 ttps://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module
 _id=326137)
