SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- BI Linden Coffee (23F) -- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader: volunteer 
 to lead!**\n**Ride sweep: volunteer to sweep**\n\n**CoffeeTue rides:**\n**
 • A rotating start location\, not a school**\n**• A predetermined rout
 e**\n**• 25+/- mile routes**\n**• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pa
 ce**\n**• Usually no sweep**\n**• “short” stop for refreshment/cof
 fee mid-route at** [Linden Coffee](https://drinklindencoffee.com/)**.**\n\
 n**Click for** [Ride with GPS](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/bi
 -linden-coffee-23f/)\n\n**Like an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have
  a single pace.**\n**The CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists a
 re not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comf
 ortable paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone 
 biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last group.**\n**Be Safe
 \, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No ear buds.
  Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pum
 p/CO2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver
 \, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.
 **\n\n**Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member.** [Join here]
 (https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)
 **.**\n\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's** [Code of C
 onduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_
 id=257148&module_id=323984) **\,**\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikecl
 ub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159
 ) **\, and** [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=4543
 18)
