SUMMARY:Trek on Tuesday - Hike Welsh Mountain Nature Preserve
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nHike coordinator: Jan Zer
 foss 717-201-0530\nRescheduled from Friday November 13.\n\n\\~3.5 miles. G
 reen connector trail from Welsh Mountain over to the red Cockscomb trail a
 t Money Rocks Country Park and back to the yellow trail at Welsh Mountain.
  Actual distance and route subject to change based on day-of weather and t
 rail conditions.\n\n[Welsh Mountain Nature Preserve](https://www.lancaster
 conservancy.org/preserves/welsh-mountain/)\n[Alltrails](https://www.alltra
 ils.com/trail/us/pennsylvania/cockscomb-welsh-mountian-and-green-connector
 -trail) We will hike parts of this.\n\nThere are toilet facilities in the 
 parking lot at this preserve.\n\nPlease bring your own water and energy sn
 ack and first aid kit. I always strongly encourage bringing hiking poles. 
 Please be sure to\nfamiliarize yourself with the route and terrain to make
  sure this hike is within your capabilities.\n\nIt is hunting season so pl
 ease remember to wear blaze orange or some other high viz clothing.\n\nAft
 er hike coffee/lunch at [Fireside Cafe](https://www.firesidecafe.net) They
  have counter service. If we are lucky the weather will be nice enough to 
 sit outside.\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we re
 quire LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being o
 n\nMeetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](h
 ttps://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n
 \nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Cod
 e of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&cl
 ub_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Inciden
 t Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2
 57148&module_id=326137)
