 ks in Leola for lunch after the ride.**\n[https://www.funcks.com/](https:/
 /www.funcks.com/)\n\n**This ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not e
 xpected to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable 
 paces. Please be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking a
 lone or being dropped off the back of the last group. We will stop to regr
 oup as needed.**\n\n**Ride with GPS links:**\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/rout
 es/57633203\n\n**Helmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 wat
 er bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 i
 nflator).**\n**Being a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. 
 Use this link to join the club.**\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/cont
